*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_initialize_one_of_two_same_fields
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 REC-1.
   05 SCORE PIC 9(3) VALUE 100.
01 REC-2.
   05 SCORE PIC 9(3) VALUE 200.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    INITIALIZE SCORE OF REC-1.
    DISPLAY SCORE OF REC-1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING SCORE OF REC-1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "000"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [000] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY SCORE OF REC-2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING SCORE OF REC-2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "200"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [200] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

